/* info-negara.js — Info Terkini data for BIG (shared by the client dashboard and the public page).
   The single place for country figures, sources, review dates and news. Update here only; republish both pages.
   Needs from the host page: state.lang and the helpers x, L, esc, fmt, svg, ico, stat, info, nb, bars, stackBar.
   News: public:true shows an item on the public page; pub:{title:[bm,en], body:[bm,en]} = public text (else the normal text).
   On the public page only media with donor:true and sens:false are shown, and the location is the area name.
   News sources: src:'field' = BIG field team; any other src is a key of SRC. For media items (type:'media'),
   add url: the exact article link. The summary must be BIG's own words; never paste the article or its photos.
   verif (field items only): 'awal' = preliminary estimate, 'sah' = confirmed by the field team.
   upd: [{at:'YYYY-MM-DD', note:[bm,en]}] = corrections or updates after publishing, newest last.
   News stays in the archive permanently; only the emergency banner ends after 14 days (or `until`). */
